@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### Start a top-up (idempotent: reuse the key on retry)
POST {{base}}/payments/deposits/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "wallet": {{main}}, "amount": "5000", "channel": "momo", "payer_phone": "0772000111", "idempotency_key": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555" }

### Poll its status (pending -> confirmed / failed / expired)
# confirm in mock mode: docker compose exec web python manage.py mock_webhook <reference>
GET {{base}}/payments/deposits/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit history for one child
GET {{base}}/payments/deposits/?student={{student}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Money received from relatives (top-up links)
GET {{base}}/payments/deposits/?from_contributor=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
